@baseUrl = http://localhost/api

### Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/

###

### Create Knowledge Base Chunk
POST {{baseUrl}}/aibot/knowledge-base/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "chunk_text": "This is the first chunk of text.",
    "url": "https://example.com/page1"
}

###

### List Knowledge Base Chunks
GET {{baseUrl}}/aibot/knowledge-base/?page=1&page_size=10

###

### Get Knowledge Base Chunk By ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/aibot/knowledge-base/1/

###

### Update Knowledge Base Chunk
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/aibot/knowledge-base/1/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "chunk_text": "Updated chunk text."
}

###

### Delete Knowledge Base Chunk
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/aibot/knowledge-base/1/

###

### Chat with AI Bot
POST {{baseUrl}}/aibot/knowledge-base/chat/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "message": "Explain me more about your mentorship program.",
    "similarity_threshold": 0.3,
    "top_k": 5
}

###